 "notes": "Policy forms: planned JSON on aws_efs_file_system_policy (provider-normalised, keys sorted, so one statement's Action, Effect and Principal are adjacent), declared heredoc/jsonencode text (tokens within one statement's text), or a policy document referenced by the file-system policy. policy_allow binds Allow + all EFS actions + any principal to one statement; the other two bind Allow with the actions and with the principal. The SID is not bound to that statement."
